
From 217eee9ee415cb4abf19ec1b491b1c0fd83668c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 10:23:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] arm64: dts: amlogic: s6: add clocks, reset, pinmux and
 peripherals

Extend the S6 SoC dtsi with the clock controllers (PLL and
peripherals), the SCMI clock provider and shared memory, OP-TEE, the
reset controller, a CPU OPP table with cpufreq clocks, PMU, vrtc,
watchdog, hwrng, the pinmux function groups for the peripherals
(I2C, UART, eMMC, SD, SDIO, IR remote, Ethernet), the Ethernet MAC
with its MDIO mux, SPICC0, I2C0-5, UART A/C and the three SD/eMMC
controllers.

The pinmux groups use the existing amlogic,pinctrl-s6 binding.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
